<title>USA: Chase Brass Industries changes name.</title>
<headline>Chase Brass Industries changes name.</headline>
<dateline>MONTPELIER, Ohio 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chase Brass Industries Inc said Thursday it has changed its name to Chase Industries Inc.</p>
<p>The company's symbol on the New York Stock Exchange remains the same --.</p>
</text>
